flowchart LR
    C[Web and mobile clients] --> GW[API gateway]
    GW --> SS[Search service]
    SS --> IDX[(Search index<br/>geo, filters, price bands,<br/>coarse availability)]
    SS --> AC[(Availability cache<br/>hotel, room type, date)]
    GW --> BK[Booking service<br/>hold, confirm, cancel,<br/>idempotency]
    BK --> INV[(Inventory DB<br/>relational, sharded by hotel_id)]
    BK --> BDB[(Bookings DB<br/>state machine rows, outbox)]
    BK --> PAY[Payment service]
    PAY --> PSP[External PSP]
    INV -->|CDC| K[Kafka]
    BDB -->|outbox relay| K
    K --> AC
    K --> IDX
    K --> DN[Notifications, hotel sync,<br/>analytics, ledger]
    EXT[Hotel extranet and<br/>channel managers] --> INVAPI[Inventory API<br/>versioned upserts] --> INV
    SW[Hold expiry sweeper] --> BK
